WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,440
Brother, I'm sorry

2
00:00:01,440 --> 00:00:03,190
I didn't know it was your father

3
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:04,310
What happened back then

4
00:00:04,310 --> 00:00:05,950
Make it clear what you know

5
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:07,190
That time you hit your father

6
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:08,710
I took people there

7
00:00:08,710 --> 00:00:10,030
I was asked to teach him a lesson

8
00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:11,630
Let him stop taking the lead in making trouble

9
00:00:11,630 --> 00:00:12,670
There's more

10
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:15,960
I really don't know anything else

11
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:17,840
Demolition is not my turn

12
00:00:17,840 --> 00:00:19,400
I just listened to people running errands

13
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,560
I beat my dad that night

14
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:21,640
Those people are present

15
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:24,240
Raise your hand

16
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:26,360
OK you can go

17
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:30,200
I beat my dad that night

18
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,120
It's all here, right?

19
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:36,130
Brother, we also listen to others’ orders

20
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:37,330
Tell me about it

21
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:38,930
How should this account be calculated?

22
00:00:38,930 --> 00:00:39,930
You want me to take action

23
00:00:39,930 --> 00:00:41,330
Or do it yourself

24
00:00:41,330 --> 00:00:43,390
me ourselves ourselves

25
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:58,730
I didn't say stop

26
00:00:58,730 --> 00:00:59,730
The security team is here

27
00:00:59,730 --> 00:01:02,260
Are you happy?

28
00:01:02,260 --> 00:01:06,930
Who is causing trouble here? It's you.

29
00:01:06,930 --> 00:01:10,560
Yes, it's me
